{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "b3e8e716e64d963642746d7cafc84ea1d63f1852b7d84d5f5c3196583fd25de1", "ja": "スーツのCM撮影　本番前", "zh": "西装广告拍摄　正式拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5000_place", "source_sha256": "4222b16a94027d9b41a774ff7467a099f25e9a6459c1a35f8b8ea4c1a5e21243", "ja": "撮影スタジオの控室", "zh": "摄影棚的休息室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5001_p", "source_sha256": "baed04ae77229b4470ad8b72de4de3b05df8ae6eff15ca1fe71f5fc5502d39ea", "ja": "（スタイリッシュなスーツのCMが撮りたい、\nとの事で、歩にオファーが来た）", "zh": "（听说想拍摄一支时尚西装的广告，所以步收到了邀约。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4f2b1e6f70083613856a178781bf715f20ec1fff2b3751bbaa53026ac91162de", "ja": "{$P$}、着替えてきたよ！\n今日はバッチリ決めるからね。イエーイ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，我换好衣服啦！\n今天一定会好好表现的。耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5003_p", "source_sha256": "ca8a88eb815e81d0ce9ba7d8b8444ee39312d8678dd7e7e202c59c294ebc4c9f", "ja": "うん、よく似合ってるよ。\nその恰好でダンスするわけだけど、平気そうか？", "zh": "嗯，很适合你。\n要穿着那身衣服跳舞，没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3a68b95b71f682c2f763c91796e1849bd3bbf094037185c894a37ed9f3b9890f", "ja": "へへっ♪　任せてよ！　あ、でも……\nどんなダンスがいいかは、ちょっと悩んでてさ。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪交给我吧！啊，不过……\n我有点在纠结跳什么样的舞比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c8f60e4dd5876d50d8e32a7b24728f7388a14aef17d4ad2b537ad683ba1f5ce9", "ja": "いい感じで！　としか言われてないから……。\n{$P$}、アドバイス、プリーズ！", "zh": "对方只说了“感觉差不多就行！”……\n{$P$}，给我点建议，拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5006_p", "source_sha256": "d4fe953a5452975e93d6a94a2050e4c07beeba4ce430f2f52f1c0f97b122a6c3", "ja": "うーん、そうだな、ここはひとつ……", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛，就来一个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5007", "source_sha256": "739eec443348532d7ea2a6793c50b392bf2ab01a8c1945ae57788c7ef9a67f52", "ja": "落ち着いた雰囲気で", "zh": "沉稳的氛围", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5008", "source_sha256": "bd7dae39fa776ac4b4e8a379220f0e6d80d6fb5db4ebcab8f5a3ac6b2bf0d0e3", "ja": "パッションだ！", "zh": "是热情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5200_p", "source_sha256": "966c6d74b1c93a495e7e3434f0826fe854c7c04303ff03bd822073bbc8e304ce", "ja": "落ち着いた雰囲気のダンスはどうだ？\nスーツをしっかりと見せられるような。", "zh": "沉稳风格的舞蹈怎么样？\n比如能把西装充分展现出来的动作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5201_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f3a0eb138efdf5eb5bb8ae3e5e05083ad0a23b102a2ad4aadd5021571e2ca5d1", "ja": "そっか！　これCMだもんね。\n激しい方が、アタシは得意だけど……。", "zh": "这样啊！毕竟这是广告嘛。\n虽然我更擅长激烈一点的舞蹈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5202_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a08078bbe5679a946cbad01bfcd11a94624aa1cbfc9ffd588bf4e2d251256d3b", "ja": "せっかくだから、チャレンジしてみるよ！\nへへっ、ワクワクしてきた♪", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我就来挑战一下吧！\n嘿嘿，开始期待起来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5300_p", "source_sha256": "966c6d74b1c93a495e7e3434f0826fe854c7c04303ff03bd822073bbc8e304ce", "ja": "落ち着いた雰囲気のダンスはどうだ？\nスーツをしっかりと見せられるような。", "zh": "沉稳风格的舞蹈怎么样？\n比如能把西装充分展现出来的动作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5301_034ayu", "source_sha256": "974b93778f031f3710b2e9961bb7221ee674f94796aae9fa3fa66359e45cf572", "ja": "なるほど、落ち着いた感じね……オッケー！\nちょっと難しそうだけど、チャレンジしてみるよ！", "zh": "原来如此，是沉稳的感觉啊……好！\n虽然感觉有点难，但我会试着挑战一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5302_034ayu", "source_sha256": "93d0a4f62c98b7232f098eab19f500af284f5e1d529d824e1c776588ba9fca51", "ja": "えっと、こうかな？　イエ～……イ……？\nあ、あれ、なんか違うような……イヨォー……？", "zh": "呃，这样吗？耶～……咿……？\n啊，奇怪，好像有点不对……咿哟——……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5500_p", "source_sha256": "4fc73480410424e51ec41c3dd703a726f018cabd13276c70bee5195da8bc9cb8", "ja": "あれこれ考えるより、フィーリングだ！\n歩のダンスへの情熱をぶつけていこう。", "zh": "与其想这想那，不如靠感觉！\n把步对舞蹈的热情倾注进去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5501_034ayu", "source_sha256": "df9bb011d43e1b440d117177eff434a82089afb6c6396dcfba32756571caf155", "ja": "おっ、{$P$}はわかってるな～♪\nダンスはやっぱり、パッションだよね！", "zh": "哦，{$P$}很懂嘛～♪\n跳舞果然还是要有激情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5502_034ayu", "source_sha256": "13a8ec08389b61035e77b8bba15e1cd9b9df24d480a4240fa07d600c8079ed6b", "ja": "よーし、アタシの全てをぶつけてくるよ！\n動きやすさのアピールにもなると思うしね。イエーイ！", "zh": "好——我要把我的全部都倾注进去！\n我觉得这也能展现出行动方便呢。耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5600_p", "source_sha256": "4fc73480410424e51ec41c3dd703a726f018cabd13276c70bee5195da8bc9cb8", "ja": "あれこれ考えるより、フィーリングだ！\n歩のダンスへの情熱をぶつけていこう。", "zh": "与其想这想那，不如靠感觉！\n把步对舞蹈的热情倾注进去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5601_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c9776b7d22a0feed95a625752103d6391e4543e661060cc9423c45ea491758a9", "ja": "えっ、いいの！？　せっかくスーツなんだし、\nそれに合わせたダンスとか……", "zh": "诶，可以吗！？难得穿着西装，\n跳点与之相配的舞蹈什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_5602_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f307580cd885f636bbaffeaa9f5c71b4e441701a3a638383246202eb6bd302ea", "ja": "ううん、考えたらダメだよね！\nよーし、考えないぞ、考えない、考えない……！", "zh": "不对，仔细想想，这样可不行吧！\n好——我不想了，不想了，不想了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
